sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Python script
  participant P as CUCM Publisher :8443
  participant DB as Config database
  S->>P: POST /axl/  (trailing slash)<br/>Authorization: Basic app-user<br/>Content-Type: text/xml<br/>SOAPAction: "CUCM:DB ver=14.0 addPhone"
  Note over S,P: Body = SOAP Envelope > Body > ns:addPhone<br/>xmlns:ns="http://www.cisco.com/AXL/API/14.0"
  alt bad password
    P-->>S: 401 Unauthorized (no SOAP body)
  else user lacks "Standard AXL API Access"
    P-->>S: 403 Forbidden
  else request OK
    P->>DB: insert phone row
    P-->>S: 200 OK  addPhoneResponse<br/>#lt;return#gt;{uuid}#lt;/return#gt;
  else data error (duplicate, missing tag, not found)
    P-->>S: 500 + soapenv:Fault<br/>faultstring + axlcode
  end
